     [38;5;246musername: [required(), minLength(3)]. Built-in factories plus custom rules as plain functions. Extension is local [39m
     [38;5;246mto the form.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m B: Plain-data schema
     [38;5;246musername: { required: true, minLength: 3 }. Simplest to read, JSON-serializable, but new rule types require editing
[39m     [38;5;246mthe shared validator.[39m
